---
import { SITE } from "../lib/config";
import { zones } from "../data/zones";

interface Props {
  zoneName?: string;
  arrivalTime?: string;
}

const { zoneName, arrivalTime = SITE.arrivalTime } = Astro.props;
const place = zoneName ?? SITE.location;
---

<section id="quien-viene" class="section band-dark">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Nada de centralitas</span>
      <h2>Quién va a llamar a <span class="accent">tu puerta</span></h2>
      <p class="subhead">
        Cuando marcas ese número no te atiende un comercial que luego subcontrata el aviso. Hablas con
        {" "}{SITE.technicianName}, que es quien se sube a la furgoneta.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="who">
      <figure class="who__card">
        <img
          src="/images/urgencias-24h-480.webp"
          alt="Cerrajero de NavaLlave llegando de noche a un portal con su maletín"
          width="480"
          height="320"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <figcaption>
          <span class="who__name">{SITE.technicianName}</span>
          <span class="who__role">Cerrajero de guardia en {place}</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <ul class="who__facts">
        <li>
          <span class="who__icon" style="background: var(--c-orange)">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M6.5 3h3l1.5 4-2 1.5a12 12 0 006.5 6.5l1.5-2 4 1.5v3a2 2 0 01-2.2 2A17 17 0 014.5 5.2 2 2 0 016.5 3z" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <strong>Hablas con quien viene</strong>
            <p>Te coge el teléfono el propio técnico, no una centralita que reparte avisos.</p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li>
          <span class="who__icon" style="background: var(--t-blue-ink)">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M3 14l1.4-4.6A2 2 0 016.3 8h11.4a2 2 0 011.9 1.4L21 14v4h-2.5" />
              <path d="M3 14v4h2.5M3 14h18" />
              <circle cx="7" cy="17" r="1.5" />
              <circle cx="17" cy="17" r="1.5" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <strong>Furgoneta rotulada</strong>
            <p>Llega un vehículo identificado y un técnico con uniforme. Sabes a quién abres.</p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li>
          <span class="who__icon" style="background: var(--t-violet-ink)">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
              <path d="M12 7v5l3 2" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <strong>{arrivalTime} hasta {place}</strong>
            <p>Es el tiempo medio desde que cuelgas. Si vamos a tardar más, te lo decimos al llamar.</p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li>
          <span class="who__icon" style="background: var(--t-green-ink)">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.4-2.9 8.3-7 9.5C7.9 19.3 5 15.4 5 11V6l7-3z" />
              <path d="M9.5 12l1.8 1.8 3.4-3.6" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <strong>Precio cerrado y factura</strong>
            <p>El importe se acuerda por teléfono antes de salir, y se factura lo acordado.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    {
      !zoneName && (
        <p class="who__zones">
          Cubrimos{" "}
          {zones.map((zone, i) => (
            <>
              {i > 0 && " · "}
              <a href={`/zonas/${zone.slug}/`}>{zone.name}</a>
            </>
          ))}
        </p>
      )
    }
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .who {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 899px) { .who { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .who__card {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .12);
  }
  .who__card img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .who__card figcaption {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: .15rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .who__name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
    color: var(--c-white);
  }
  .who__role { font-size: var(--fs-sm); color: #93A3B5; }

  .who__facts { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; }
  .who__facts li { display: flex; gap: 1.1rem; align-items: flex-start; }
  .who__icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: var(--r-xs);
    color: var(--c-white);
  }
  .who__facts strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--c-white);
    margin-bottom: .15rem;
  }
  .who__facts p { margin: 0; font-size: var(--fs-sm); color: #AEBDCD; max-width: 46ch; }

  .who__zones a {
    color: #AEBDCD;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: .15em;
  }
  .who__zones a:hover { color: var(--c-orange); }

  .who__zones {
    margin: 3rem auto 0;
    max-width: 54rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: #7F90A3;
  }
</style>
